{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3f3c7c49036107767994708a412690f130a758192509005a4b752a010e065cf6", "ja": "英語に苦戦しながら、消えた翼を必死に探す\nのり子と美奈子。と、そこに翼がくじ引きで\n当てたダイビングのチケットを手に戻って\nくる。翼はプロデューサーに叱られないかと\n心配するが、迷子は3人だけの秘密に。", "zh": "法子跟美奈子拚命寻找不见人影的翼，\n为此艰辛地使用英文沟通。\n就在此时，翼拿着抽奖抽中的潜水券回来了。\n翼很怕会被制作人责骂，\n最后迷路的事成为了三人间的秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "b404530b03f2e3f4f32d469c2fa90cc74c584c5102c451c7b6ffcd5f249523c3", "ja": "ど、どうしよう……！　翼ちゃんが消えちゃった！\nメッセージを送っても既読にならないし……。", "zh": "该、该怎么办……！小翼不见了！\n传讯过去她也没有看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "7613c24d8b127c45e5efd30aa5f72af99b61a1d4e8fb62a4be716b388a75728c", "ja": "落ち着こう、美奈子。はぐれたとしても、\nまだそんなに遠くには行ってないはずだよ。", "zh": "美奈子，先别慌张。\n就算真的走散了，她应该也还没有跑远。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "226676d0f42d2edfc2844f639bb62452f75603ae334ab2fd5c714e340b496927", "ja": "う、うん……すー、はー、すー、はー。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……（吸气──吐气──吸气──吐气──）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "4ee671fb130ba0ba89372e645e8dc55fd3e71200b78838245608ea9a66b8571e", "ja": "翼なら大丈夫だと思うけど……外国だし、知らない\n土地をひとりで歩かせるわけにはいかないよ。", "zh": "翼的话自己一个人应该也没问题……不过这里\n毕竟是外国，我们也不能放她独自在陌生的地方行动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "0483c59d36baf59350ae573410502ef8f44f137a3b127989dc0aa4dd5264768a", "ja": "とりあえず、周りの人に聞いてみよう！", "zh": "总而言之，我们先问问附近的人吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "5ba54bd78a5e91370c83fe40325e9d07be52f772ef19ac851ca131344b3c7bff", "ja": "そうだね！\nあのっ、すみません！", "zh": "有道理！\n那个，不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "c736a3008123841b5800247df1bd0feb0ad333436c7b2d12d1fc4dfd75bf060a", "ja": "えっと、あのその……。\n中学生くらいの女の子を見ませんでしたか？", "zh": "呃，就是……那个……\n请问你有没有看到一个大约国中生年纪的女孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "a5035d4fd98794f9fb989e0edb79d69af3b05ee50323398cb2750967bfe2b3dd", "ja": "日本語じゃ通じないよ。\nちゃんと英語で話しかけないと！", "zh": "说日语人家听不懂啦。\n要用英文询问才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "cb158056e0245e356d167d5a710da06c944ebfcb0b58b8a2bb4f963a137fe3e4", "ja": "そ、それもそうだね。えっと、髪がちょっと跳ねた……\nヘアー、ジャンプ……ジャンピングヘアーガール！", "zh": "对、对喔。呃，她是个头发有点翘的……\nHair、Jump……Jumping Hair Girl！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "1f7cdf3ff82b26e40dcdbf49a1c10d5e49dbd62d6b654bf95e54a5765b7d9929", "ja": "金髪！　コレ、アタシの髪と同じ！　中学生！\nキュート！　かわいい！　ジャパニーズアイドル！", "zh": "她是金发！看这里，跟我的头发一样！国中生！\nCute！可爱！Japanese Idol！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "40ec13d20ba2c41b81c8a6fd1b4e0bdc7cbca4dd8d2b72a4ec1546cb00b30e0f", "ja": "ダメだー！　全然通じてる気がしない！\nソーリー、サンキュー、グッバイ！", "zh": "不行！根本完全无法沟通！\nSorry、Thank you、Good bye！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "4eba006a3b86c4b30ad8b84f1de0e4ecb1480f314a4027184859575f3046768a", "ja": "私、あっちを探してくる！\n見つけたら携帯に連絡を……。", "zh": "我到那里去找找看！\n如果找到了就用手机通知……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c1faf75de0a708a5682628b6a82af2f9bfea110b0fdc328d130c4aeebb36df43", "ja": "あー、いたー！", "zh": "啊──找到了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "d3e6967b571bbf83ff1f9c3472dac373f96b6a58d0ea3b32b6226d5bbc3a948c", "ja": "この声……翼！？", "zh": "这声音是……翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "19bd616770a4b76b2a2b1bcd8559558d9e44e3625dbc2c6254133c5a41b50a6d", "ja": "もー、ビックリしちゃいましたよー。\nお土産屋さんに戻ったら、2人ともいないんだもん。", "zh": "真是的～吓了我一大跳～\n我刚刚一回到礼品店，就发现你们都不见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "13bcd871a197d7661e1c571c50c81d111a80cb10d2b5817269094ce9a8db741b", "ja": "携帯を部屋に忘れてきちゃったわたしも\nいけないんですけど……あれ、どうかしました？", "zh": "虽然我自己把手机忘在房间里也有错就是了……\n咦，你们怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "6ca7deaea59393a87287d8136fb4a4f2f5f0e1643be99ef2ba93b702a2267a2f", "ja": "よ、よかったあああぁぁぁ……！\nうう、安心したら腰の力が抜けちゃったよう。", "zh": "太、太好了啊啊啊啊……！\n呜呜，一放下心来腰好像就没力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "e2691137b62a209f1e51e3c2526f308cdc20ba64606e4787fe0cd10651dbb6a3", "ja": "翼、ビックリさせないでよ～！\n突然姿が見えなくなったから、心配したんだよ！？", "zh": "翼，你别吓我们好不好～！\n刚刚你突然不见，我们真的很担心耶！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0e428940c0fc41c3d350f56f8ac540f6dd58f84914081eecc0507e6514c4f586", "ja": "ごめんなさーい。2人を待ってる間、\nアイスを食べてたんですけど……。", "zh": "对不起啦～刚刚在等你们的时候，\n我原本在吃冰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "66eafaf941bd87a183924cb78954797579a5a2713ce5c14490f555ccf6d32d53", "ja": "そしたら、くじ引きの券をもらったんです。\nお土産屋さんの目の前だったから、大丈夫かと思って。", "zh": "然后就拿到抽奖券了。\n我想说抽奖的地方就在礼品店对面，应该没关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "127c27a0ef72c5a5e866af707430426dbec1808838cb75914b8d94acd402537b", "ja": "くじ引き？", "zh": "抽奖券？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "c4af7d7b501f2cbc1d4f5d9c4d8aa7b02ea08a0a98b37c26f1198761fa09accb", "ja": "理由はわかったけど、単独行動は禁止！\n移動する時は、アタシか美奈子にひと声かけること！", "zh": "我了解原因了，不过还是禁止独自行动！\n不管去哪里，都要先跟我或美奈子说一声才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bfeb1b0a96259e9e0abedaef2a92b9f06819784ed4e912f15df262cfb2495a65", "ja": "はーい。今度から気をつけまーす！", "zh": "好～我以后会注意的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "0e2311008139d797e94df4a157c2ba1380448e40903c769d423e391b65bbde72", "ja": "うん、わかればよし！", "zh": "嗯，知道就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "33b7fbff939d248db40da010f98553b2ee7efdd1b141d54dbc1eed8e534c2ec5", "ja": "でも、こっちはちょっと、ほめてほしいかも～。\n……ほらっ♪", "zh": "不过，有件事，我希望你们可以称赞我一下～\n……你们看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "088f6973efaea94bcebd2ed93e796ba0b03bec3a6884b8403b61dd235411da9c", "ja": "くじ引きで、『熱帯魚と泳ぐダイビングツアー』の\n無料体験チケット、ゲットしちゃいました♪", "zh": "我用抽奖券抽到了\n『与热带鱼同游潜水之旅』的免费体验票喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "973cf87ed39afd819df496c465b3753fc68fec7b925a1659f7de05bf51305ab2", "ja": "ええーっ！？\n翼ちゃん、くじ引き当てたの！？", "zh": "什么──！？\n小翼你中奖了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d0d4c269dc445514a47159bc8d7365398f62fd59059d6793613f66b41449da12", "ja": "はい♪　2人分あるから、足りない分だけ\nみんなでお金を出し合えば、行けますよね！", "zh": "没错♪因为有两张，剩下不够的部分只要大家分摊一下，\n就可以一起去了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "05f0f96f54eca3c7c5af4ef96be4199b9b62d2c687bb4a92d4e0af1cd98db60d", "ja": "翼、すごい！　天才っ！", "zh": "翼你太厉害了！根本天才！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "11a945941e7027b00343d0dbf87a70883bca38c241fab6216d86b43d42e8ff54", "ja": "えへへ～。\nこれで、バカンスの思い出が増えますね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿～\n这样一来，我们的度假回忆又增加了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "99ff3f05d92837d47076d82540505e10540ae073bb346ce03fc25701207c5333", "ja": "あ、でも勝手に行ったらダメだよね？\n{$P$}さんに連絡しないと。", "zh": "啊，可是我们不能擅自参加吧？\n得先跟{$P$}先生说一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "eddb6da320e38b1fcad3a16e1770326e62176eb069d1c92fdb23d809ca76b659", "ja": "あっ、ちょうど{$P$}から連絡……\n『問題なく、楽しめてるか？』だって。", "zh": "啊，刚好{$P$}传讯息过来了……\n他说：『玩得还开心吗？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "e02f2528c9ce97d46806e43c6bd56e2f63e1f5220dadafda16f8fccd4dedb803", "ja": "翼ちゃんとはぐれちゃったこと、\n報告しておいたほうがいいのかな。でも……。", "zh": "我们跟小翼走散的事，\n是不是要跟他报告一下比较好呢？可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "03f9ee8a43d1464d96ffbae300245c819d66e379307c3a602bc01b69ac5b6fec", "ja": "{$P$}さんに報告したら、\nやっぱり怒られちゃいますか……？", "zh": "如果跟{$P$}先生说了，\n我是不是会被骂啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1038_019min", "source_sha256": "8fe0ac5081798ab94a0958982ce437d0a26d21fe61e922ac7e4967f762653433", "ja": "うーん……。\nね、のり子ちゃん……。", "zh": "嗯……\n欸，小法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "161cc2eef2f4f9a482a91d2b0459e18565ed9ec6d7f5bda17d59c3f992f73aae", "ja": "『大丈夫、バカンス楽しんでるよ♪　それより、翼が\nダイビングのチケット当てたんだけど、行っていい？』", "zh": "『完全没问题，我们正在享受假期呢♪先不说这个了，\n翼她抽到了潜水券，我们可以去吗？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
