{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2f110215b2ad0a795d16532008506f0c396c01943ba69a7c5a4bed5defd7ce71", "ja": "えっ……！\nのり子さん、美奈子さん、いいの！？", "zh": "咦……！\n法子、美奈子，没关系吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1042_019min", "source_sha256": "ad856037e25de93336bd2c8a1d8b954f7fe553b0c072dda83e59332639ab6609", "ja": "うん。だって翼ちゃんが、バカンスを楽しむために、\nやってくれた事だもんね。", "zh": "嗯，因为刚刚小翼会那么做，\n是为了让大家能够更享受假期嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "5129ab208dc290ed393ed403acb7abfae98007a816dc3864a86414ebd8d6dfa4", "ja": "そのかわり、アタシ達だけの秘密だよ！\n{$P$}にバレたら、怒られるからさ。", "zh": "所以就把这件事当作我们之间的秘密吧！要是\n被{$P$}知道，你会被骂到臭头的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e481c6eab053c119f6f14173c4e1a428c205d748344a390c8d0aff4bb3bbbf4a", "ja": "うん！\n美奈子さん、のり子さん、ありがとう！", "zh": "嗯！\n美奈子、法子，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1045_043nor", "source_sha256": "710f6f48cd1f3cccb307beca7609d9e3d1dad94a1554f19b785d650db5dc532b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}から返信来た。\n撮影順調だから、こっちに来てくれるって！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}回讯了。\n他说拍摄一切顺利，所以要过来我们这边耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "35c31d966cd8bcd78db2a95d939a850e58fd9dd69858e619b50d9a54dfef1a90", "ja": "ホントに！？　やったぁ♪", "zh": "真的吗！？好耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "468f738dad3398bdc06c2e426f3f24eab8459c7dc17f7f42e5a3c944c11de600", "ja": "{$P$}さんが来てくれたら、\nもっと楽しくなるね！", "zh": "如果{$P$}先生过来陪我们，\n一定会变得更好玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_05_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "133ce4373a7c6fa45405785865f8e7f0f6dedd68e9cf74444b65a63742d0e6f5", "ja": "よーし！　それじゃ{$P$}と一緒に、\n熱帯魚と水中散歩……行っちゃおーう！", "zh": "好──那就出发吧！跟{$P$}一起……\n和热带鱼在水里散步──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
